a brawl turns deadly in laughlin one man  is dead after police say a big fight  erupted  at the aquarius hotel early this morning  victoria saha has the details from  loughlin  metro police and homicide detectives  spend majority of their day  inside the aquarius hotel trying to  piece together what happened  some of the guests i spoke with today  say some parts of the hotel  were blocked off to them this is video a  witness shared with us you can see  bystanders and what looks like security  attend to someone on the floor  after the fight police tell us the big  fight broke out  with up to 30 people early this morning  inside the hotel  they say when they got there there was a  victim unresponsive  this person was taken to the hospital  where he died some guests tell me they  were told to avoid the mcdonald's area  and there are still cones and  crime tape up this afternoon i guess he  got  beat up pretty bad like my three i don't  know it's like a whole bunch of people  they said  so they got i guess they jumped they  jumped them pretty much and they threw a  barstool at the guy  police have not said if they made any  arrests the witness also tells us he saw  a couple of other people being helped  out by paramedics but  police would not confirm that reporting  from laughlin victoria saha 8 news now
 

